#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:3 76687c06811449cfa37ba49ddeee5980
msgid ""
"This section introduces the FiveAges Sim ecosystem — what it is, how its "
"components fit together, and how to navigate the documentation."
msgstr "本节介绍 FiveAges Sim 生态系统——它是什么、各组件如何协同，以及如何浏览文档。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:5 51fdc09c42394dfd89768906218ba8f6
msgid "What is FiveAges Sim?"
msgstr "什么是 FiveAges Sim？"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:7 79ba6d7ba50b439a882b9a0bbc31e3ef
msgid "FiveAges Sim is a collection of ROS 2 packages and workspaces that enable:"
msgstr "FiveAges Sim 是一组 ROS 2 软件包与工作空间，可用于："

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:9 cba1302ae1e54322b8f0da3f4d364d04
msgid "**Robot Description** — URDF/xacro models with ros2_control integration"
msgstr "**机器人描述** — 集成 ros2_control 的 URDF/xacro 模型"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:10 813bc191482240a3a94f7f5220b013c6
msgid "**Hardware Control** — Interface plugins for real robot hardware"
msgstr "**硬件控制** — 对接真实机器人硬件的接口插件"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:11 226993ca69d94d239100af7108972f73
msgid "**MPC Controllers** — OCS2-based motion planning and control"
msgstr "**MPC 控制器** — 基于 OCS2 的运动规划与控制"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:12 1ac5964de369471b8c11a1f8c79ec52b
msgid "**Simulation** — Gazebo Harmonic and NVIDIA Isaac Sim backends"
msgstr "**仿真** — Gazebo Harmonic 与 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 后端"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:13 0504e185572c45d4a3ce282baf899d1d
msgid "**Teleoperation** — VR, isomorphic teleop, and glove-based control"
msgstr "**遥操作** — VR、同构遥操作以及基于手套的控制"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:14 7183227d26b146b89a5b38a2662e504a
msgid ""
"**Python Applications** — High-level APIs for data collection and "
"autonomous tasks"
msgstr "**Python 应用** — 用于数据采集与自主任务的高层 API"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:15 ac8b8befb29144b59d863feed2a1bc6c
msgid ""
"**Synthetic data** — Isaac Sim USD → interface → composer → LeRobot "
"record/export ([Synthetic Data](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md))"
msgstr ""
"**合成数据** — Isaac Sim USD → 接口 → composer → LeRobot "
"录制/导出（[合成数据](../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md)）"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:17 4af8a3e95d1a495a99f6449bb6f6806f
msgid "Terminology"
msgstr "术语"

#: ../../source/0-overview/0-index.md:20 7d5234062f89424caa18db0510d53862
msgid ""
"In this documentation, **humanoid** means a **wheeled-arm humanoid** "
"(mobile base + arms, e.g. FiveAges W2/W2R). It does **not** mean a "
"bipedal or footed humanoid."
msgstr ""
"在本文档中，**humanoid / 人形机器人** 指 **轮臂人形**（移动底盘 + 双臂，例如 FiveAges "
"W2/W2R），**不是** 双足或足式人形。"

